ublic launch - exclusive access\n\n### Distress Properties\n\nBelow market value - urgent sales & motivated sellers\n\n### Real Estate Builders\n\nExplore projects directly from top developers\n\n### Global Properties\n\nDubai, Singapore & international investment markets\n\n### Weekend Properties\n\nFarmhouses, hill retreats & holiday homes\n\n### Commercial Properties\n\nShops, showrooms, offices & mixed-use spaces\n\n### Expat Properties\n\nDedicated NRI division & expat-friendly listings\n\n### PropertyCrow.com\n\nHomes for Everyone\n\nPropertyCrow.com is a venture by Realspace Assets LLP. India's most trusted real estate platform with 30+ years of combined expertise.\n\n#### Properties in India\n\n#### Enlist Zone\n\n#### Get In Touch\n\n**DISCLAIMER:** We are in compliance of the newly introduced housing laws i.e. the Maha Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and the rules and regulations notified thereunder. We are in process of providing information in this website as required under Real Estate (Development and Regulation) Act, 2016 and the Rules and Regulations thereunder. Viewers are advised not to rely upon the contents hereof. The contents of this website are not intended and are not to be regarded as an advertisement, marketing, invitation to book or purchase or offer for sale or solicitation of any real estate project or any phases thereof. The Company in no circumstance shall be liable for any expense, loss or damage including, without limitation, indirect or consequential loss or damage, or any expense, loss or damage whatsoever arising from use of any data, arising out of or in connection with the use of this website or any action taken by the viewer relying on such material / information on this website.\n\nCopyright © 2016-2026. All Rights Reserved. **Realspace Assets LLP**\n\n## Looking for Your Dream Property?\n\nShare your requirements and we'll find the perfect match\n\nBy submitting you agree to our privacy policy. We'll contact