ject situated in the heart of Girgaon, Mumbai. This project offers a unique blend of comfort, convenience, and modern amenities, making it an ideal choice for those seeking a perfect blend of lifestyle and investment. Located just 3.1 km away from the Eastern Freeway, residents can enjoy seamless connectivity to various parts of the city. Additionally, the project is just 1.9 km away from Sir Jamshetji Jeejeebhoy Road, providing easy access to important landmarks and amenities.\n\nThe project is carefully designed to cater to the needs of modern homebuyers, with a range of world-class amenities on offer. From a cricket pitch for sports enthusiasts to power backup and 24x7 security for added convenience, every aspect of the project has been thoughtfully planned. The project also features a normal park/central green, providing a peaceful oasis in the heart of the bustling city. The units come with vitrified tiles flooring in the master and other bedrooms, ensuring a comfortable and stylish living space.\n\nAt Hindustan Klockner Sea Pearl, we offer a range of luxurious units to choose from, including 2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK apartments, and studios. With areas ranging from 684 to 1698 sq. ft., these units come with competitive pricing, starting from 3.70 Cr for a studio and going up to 13.55 Cr for a 4 BHK apartment. This project is registered with the Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority (RERA) under registration number P51900003487. With its prime location, luxurious amenities, and affordable pricing, Hindustan Klockner Sea Pearl is set to become one of the most sought-after residential projects in the city.\n\nThe following table outlines the available unit options at Hindustan Klockner Sea Pearl:\n\n|  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Unit Type | Area (Sq. Ft.) | Price (Rs.) |\n| 2 BHK Apartment | 684 | 5.45 Cr |\n| 3 BHK Apartment | 1215 | 9.70 Cr |\n| 4 BHK Apartment | 1698 | 13.55 Cr |\n| Studio | 465 | 3.70 Cr |\n\nThe upcoming residential project is situated in a prime location, amidst numerous landmark establishments that provide a balanced blend of convenience, comfort, and lifestyle for its residents. These landmarks not only add to the property s desirability but also ensure that residents have access to essential amenities and services.\n\nIn resale we have 1 properties available ranging from 2 BHK having price from 4.50 CR\n\n|  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Listing Type | Total Listings | Unit Type Range | Price Range |\n| Resale | 1 | 2 BHK | 4.50 CR |\n\nThe real estate market has witnessed a remarkable trend in the past few months, with the current government-registered transactions showcasing a substantial price growth. Over the past three months, the price has surged by 50,830, culminating in a current rate of 79,720. Similarly, a six-month analysis reveals a price movement of 49,920, resulting in the same current rate. Looking further back, the past year s transactions follow a similar pattern, with a price appreciation of 53,422, leading to the current rate of 79,720. These figures provide a clear indication of the market s upward trajectory, highlighting its potential for long-term growth and investment opportunities.\n\n## Hindustan Klockner Sea Pearl Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Hindustan Klockner Sea Pearl.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Studio  465 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 3.70 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  684 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 5.45 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1215 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 9.70 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 4 BHK Apartment  1698 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 13.55 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nHindustan Klockner Sea Pearl's average asking price is stable quarter-on-quarter, compared with Girgaon.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Hindustan Klockner Sea Pearl | Girgaon |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 38350 | 0 |\n| Mar 2026 | 38600 | 115900 |\n| Dec 2025 | 33650 | 77700 |\n| Sep 2025 | 32100 | 44550 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nHindustan Klockner Sea Pearl avg. price is ₹ 38.4 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Girgaon at ₹ 1.2 L/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| Girgaon | ₹ 1.15 L |\n| [Hubtown Ackruti Astha](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/hubtown-ackruti-astha/103655/project \"Hubtown Ackruti Astha\") | ₹ 96,550 |\n| [Piramal Mahalaxmi](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/piramal-mahalaxmi/10037/project \"Piramal Mahalaxmi\") | ₹ 71,350 |\n| [Peninsula Salsette 27](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/peninsula-salsette-27/100049/project \"Peninsula Salsette 27\") | ₹ 59,050 |\n| Current Project **Hindustan Klockner Sea Pearl** | ₹ 38,350 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Girgaon ranges from ₹ 52.6 K to ₹ 2.9 L with options available for 1,2,3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Hindustan Klockner Sea Pearl | In Girgaon |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 52.6 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 1.2 L |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 2.9 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Hindustan Klockner Sea Pearl.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Hindustan Klockner Sea Pearl moved from ₹ 33,650/sqft to ₹ 38,600/sqft, reflecting a 14.71% rise.\n\nDuring Q4'2025, average property prices for Hindustan Klockner Sea Pearl moved from ₹ 32,100/sqft to ₹ 33,650/sqft, reflecting a 4.83% rise.\n\nA total of 8 out of 12 launched units have been booked as of November 2025, including 40% of 4 BHK(2 out of 5 units), 50% of 3 BHK(1 out of 2 units), 100% of ADD. TENANT AREA(4 units), 2 BHK(1 units).\n\nStructural Works reach 100% completion, External Works has reached 68%, Internal finishing stands at 83%, MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 84% done.\n\nA total of 8 out of 11 launched units have been booked as of December 2024, including 60% of 4 BHK(3 out of 5 units), 100% of ADD. TENANT AREA(4 units), 2 BHK(1 units).\n\nInternal finishing stands at 75%, MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 72% done.\n\nExternal Works has reached 50%, Internal finishing stands at 72%, MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 72% done.\n\nMEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 64% done.\n\nStructural Works reach 99% completion, External Works has reached 43%, Internal finishing stands at 66%.\n\nA total of 7 out of 11 launched units have been booked as of May 2023, including 60% of 4 BHK(3 out of 5 units), 100% of ADD. TENANT AREA(4 units).\n\n## Hindustan Klockner Sea Pearl Floor Plans\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 2 BHK 684 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Hindustan Klockner Sea Pearl, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 5.45 Cr\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 3 BHK 1215 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Hindustan Klockner Sea Pearl, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 9.70 Cr\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 4 BHK 1698 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Hindustan Klockner Sea Pearl, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 13.55 Cr\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 465 Sq. Ft. Studio in Hindustan Klockner Sea Pearl, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:₹ 3.70 Cr\n\n## Resale Listings in Hindustan Klockner Sea Pearl\n\nExplore resale listings currently available in Hindustan Klockner Sea Pearl, Mumbai.\n\n![4 BHK Apartment For Sale in Hindustan Klockner Sea Pearl in Girgaon, Mumbai]()\n\nGirgaon, Mumbai\n\n![Dhruv Sunil Parekh  profile picture]()\n![Dhruv Sunil Parekh]()\n\n360 Mumbai Inc\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of Hindustan Klockner Sea Pearl\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-gymnasiu-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/i